== Section A — The Nature of Accounting and the Equation (Questions 1–8)

#mcq(1, [Accounting differs from bookkeeping because accounting includes],
  [the filing of source documents],
  [the writing of the cash book],
  [the interpretation of the accounts],
  [the recording of transactions]
)

#mcq(2, [A firm values its machinery at cost less depreciation although its market value has risen. This follows the],
  [realisation concept],
  [materiality concept],
  [going concern and historical cost concepts],
  [money measurement concept]
)

#mcq(3, [A trader's private electricity bill was paid from the business account and debited to rent. This is],
  [drawings],
  [a liability],
  [an expense of the business],
  [a loan to the owner]
)

